nal battle a person is fighting as  they are in public well we knew she was  strong to begin with but now it just  exposes a whole different side to this  woman it is mind-blowing to me that in  this day and age with social media and  everything else that people can keep  these types of things private yeah that  says something i'm actually heartened by  that me too  and i've always said that women should  wear capes because they can bear so much  more than they let us know that they're  dealing absolutely  that's for sure

